Accept_Options_Unit_Concrete_Test
├── when the caller is not the grantee
│   └── it should revert with OnlyGrantee
├── when the offer has expired
│   └── it should revert with OfferExpired
├── when the terms hash is not the document hash
│   └── it should revert with TermsMismatch
└── when the grantee accepts the exact terms in time
    ├── it should mark the grant accepted
    └── it should emit OptionsAccepted
